# Chromium policies. Blocking mhmkochafbhohfaebfieaalahinnplkb explicitly in
# ExtensionInstallBlocklist or ExtensionSettings ("installation_mode":
# "blocked") turns it off: it is not loaded at startup, and a runtime policy
# change disables it. The "*" wildcard deliberately does not apply.
